        "Description": "KGB spy Jasper Knight has been located in Cuba and the CIA has assembled a team to extract him before he leaves. The base is on high alert however, and they can&apos;t get him out while he&apos;s being watched by his personal bodyguard and the lieutenant colonel overseeing his departure. The agency isn&apos;t normally afraid to get their hands dirty, but are being watched closelly by higher-ups and have turned to us. Their undercover team can be anywhere, so do NOT kill anyone but the targets. Good Luck 47.",
